<title>FRANCE: Metaleurop raises zinc price to 7,430 ff.</title>
<headline>Metaleurop raises zinc price to 7,430 ff.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag on Friday raised its indicative zinc price to 7,430 francs per tonne.</p>
<p>The last change was to 7,050 francs on January 23.</p>
<p>In a statement Metaleurop said the move reflected zinc market developments and the value of the dollar.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
